    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051116.0222\n\nKUWAIT CITY, Nov. 16 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nKuwait stock exchange index down\n\n\n\n\nKuwait Stock Exchange index closed at 11,777.6 points on Wednesday, 77.9 points down from Tuesday's finish.\n\nThe turnover was 188 million Kuwaiti dinars (639.2 million US dollars) as 329 million shares were traded in 13,385 deals.",
